## Quick Reference

```
ΣΠC = Free sum-product completion
Poly = ΣΠ(Set)
Mo(C) = Monomials ⊂ ΣΠC
D(Set) = Dialectica = ΣΠ(2) + predicates

Morphism = (forward-pos, backward-dir, forward-pred)
Factor = Vertical ; Cartesian
```
